  "method": "Per-pixel phenological peak detection across 12 monthly NDVI composites (Jun\u2013May). NDVI is smoothed using a 3-month triangular filter (weights [0.25, 0.50, 0.25]). Crop cycles are resolved using scipy.signal.find_peaks with peak height \u2265 0.5, prominence \u2265 0.2, and inter-peak distance \u2265 3 months. Non-cropland (urban, open water, upland forest) is strictly excluded.",
